<title>USA: Mississippi to sell $6.5 mln GO bonds on Nov 21.</title>
<headline>Mississippi to sell $6.5 mln GO bonds on Nov 21.</headline>
<dateline>JACKSON, Miss 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mississippi will sell $6.5 million of general obligaton bonds by competitive bid on Nov 21 at 1000 EST, the state Bond Commission said.</p>
<p>The issue is designated Mississippi Small Enterprise Development Finance Act Issue, 1996 series H through O and has maturities out to 15 years.</p>
<p>Bond proceeds will finance low-interest loans to small businesses for the acquisition, expansion or equipping of manufacturing facilities.</p>
<p>--Jane Sutton, 305-374-5013</p>
